#: ../../scenarios/xml.rst:89
msgid ""
"`xmlschema <https://github.com/sissaschool/xmlschema>`_ provides support "
"for using XSD-Schemas in Python. Unlike other XML libraries, automatic "
"type parsing is available, so f.e. if the schema defines an element to be"
" of type ``int``, the parsed ``dict`` will contain also an ``int`` value "
"for that element. Moreover the library supports automatic and explicit "
"validation of XML documents against a schema."
